## Path-scoped tool policy

For any task whose effective working directory, repository, or write scope is
under `{{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir (trimPrefix "~/" .personal_folder) }}/`:

- Never invoke CodeRabbit or any CodeRabbit-backed skill, tool, review, autofix,
  or autonomous review workflow.
- Do not invoke `dispatch-atlassian`, `dispatch-gitlab`, Atlassian, Jira, or
  GitLab MCP tools.

This prohibition is scoped to `{{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir (trimPrefix "~/" .personal_folder) }}/` and its descendants.
It does not prohibit those tools for work under `{{ joinPath .chezmoi.homeDir (trimPrefix "~/" .work_folder) }}/`.
